From cc0db01ca2ed23a1dd0b2b4bbdefb7f47fd7cb1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andre <andre@rng.media>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:50:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] DocDog: RNG Media patches on PdfCraft

Name and icon, Home (no community card), About credits PdfCraft without
Discord, no title-bar Discord button or Help Discord link, glass graphite
dark theme with red accent (red light accent), upstream self-update off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
